/target
# Written when retina's own tests are run; see third_party/retina/PATCHES.md.
/third_party/retina/Cargo.lock
/third_party/retina/target
# Captures and logs from a live run. ffmpeg puts the publish URL in its stderr,
# and the stream key is in that URL, so nothing from a run belongs in the repo
# even when it looks like plain text.
/reports
/captures
*.flv
*.log
# A stream key on disk, if you keep one there rather than in a secret store.
*.key
